        70.86609649658203,
        571.6694946289062,
        527.4135131835938,
        586.1124877929688
      ],
      "text": "been developed for each of the health outcomes to facilitate understanding of the outcomes by the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
